   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating the way for an integrated approach to contribute to the SDGs &amp; Green Recovery through ABS_ 01003100</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Genetic resources are a treasure trove for humanity. Without them we would not have many of the medicines, vaccines, food, clothing, cosmetics, and other products that we take for granted every day. The international community, aware of the economic potential of genetic resources, brought forward the principle of Access and Benefit Sharing (ABS) to guarantee fairness and equitable benefits to users and providers of these resources and to promote the conservation and sustainable use of biodiversi</narrative>
  </description>
